id: caster
name: Caster
order: 1
optionOf: spirit-of-namek
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  When you hit a Studied Opponent with a Magical Attack, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete this Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  Caster [Triggered, 1/Round]: When you hit a Studied Opponent with a Magical Attack, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete this Attacking Maneuver.

---

# A Magic Attack that hit one you Studied: asked as its Wound Roll is about to be made, once a Round - Refined Combat's
# Hand to Hand, for Magic (chat.mjs answerHit).
[passive]
allow refined.caster;
